 "remarks": "Welcome to South Norwalk, an ideal living destination boasting stylish dining and shopping just moments away. Step into this bright and spacious townhouse with an inviting open floor plan, perfect for entertaining. The kitchen features a center island and gleaming hardwood floors. Upstairs, discover two generous bedrooms and a bathroom on the second floor. The upper level unveils a luxurious Master suite with ample closets and a master bath and a private set back roof deck balcony. Enjoy the convenience of a 2-car garage with direct access to the lower level, equipped with a washer, dryer, and a convenient half bath. And dont forget the grill. This home comes with a private backyard patio. Embrace the vibrant community atmosphere, making this residence a fantastic place to live and relish dining, entertainment, and all that this dynamic neighborhood has to offer. *** This is one of just a couple of END units in the complex. An additional, entire side, wall of windows for additional light and air :)",
